{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TAuP2NaCs494rTUZvbKZgV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now **sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic**. First, the engine reality: instant/sorcery spells resolving to graveyard go through `_resolve_spell` → `move_to_zone(STACK→GRAVEYARD)` with no replacement event, and `move_to_zone` only consults replacements when *leaving the battlefield*. So the plan's ReplacementEffect approach can't hook the resolution path. I'll add a minimal additive field-read at exactly that point in `_resolve_spell`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":79,"cache_read_input_tokens":157562,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":79},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a75e57b-d845-4814-b1a9-adfaef121449","uuid":"06238f65-4cad-47d4-86bf-073387823fd3","request_id":"req_011CbtRxCMtGBHPhUnPgBVAN"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TAuP2NaCs494rTUZvbKZgV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vv6UuTotzRgMhvyskGLgjU","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/engine/casting.py","old_string":"    if card.card_types & _PERMANENT_TYPES:\n        # Move from stack to battlefield via move_to_zone, which handles\n        # trigger/replacement-effect registration and ENTERS_BATTLEFIELD event.\n        move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)\n    else:\n        # Instant/sorcery: move from stack to graveyard via move_to_zone.\n        move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.GRAVEYARD)","new_string":"    if card.card_types & _PERMANENT_TYPES:\n        # Move from stack to battlefield via move_to_zone, which handles\n        # trigger/replacement-effect registration and ENTERS_BATTLEFIELD event.\n        move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)\n    else:\n        # Instant/sorcery: move from stack to its resolution zone.  A spell\n        # cast under a \"if it would be put into a graveyard, exile it instead\"\n        # effect (e.g. The Dawning Archaic) carries this flag — the normal\n        # resolution path passes no replacement_event, so this single field\n        # read at the one right point honors that redirect.  (Deliberate\n        # card-local limitation: covers the resolve-to-graveyard case.)\n        dest = Zone.GRAVEYARD\n        if getattr(card, \"_exile_instead_of_graveyard\", False):\n            dest = Zone.EXILE\n        move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, dest)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":79,"cache_read_input_tokens":157562,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":79},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"conte